            "uri": "https://github.com/urllib3/urllib3/issues/5181",
            "text": "## Summary\n\n`PoolManager.urlopen()` implements its own cross-pool redirect loop but never carries `body_pos` (the file-position bookkeeping that `HTTPConnectionPool.urlopen` uses to rewind file-like bodies before resending). On any 301/307/",
